{"id":"b0f365ef30b0b52a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-karp-reduction.md","title":"Karp Reduction","display":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-karp-reduction","aliases":["73-df-binary-karp-reduction","73-df-karp-reduction"],"display":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-karp-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-karp-reduction</span><span>73-df-karp-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m^p\">\\(\\leq_m^p\\)</span> (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两个关系均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\)</span> 为载体；关系图的有序对成员式与原中缀调用采用同一二元关系实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}karp\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\leq_K\\;\\coloneqq\\;\n\\{(A,B)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*):A\\leq_m^pB\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}karp\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\leq_K\\;\\coloneqq\\;\n\\{(A,B)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*):A\\leq_m^pB\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Karp reduction” is exactly the polynomial-time many-one relation, not an oracle or Turing reduction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_m^p$ (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\leq_m^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}karp\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\leq_K\\;\\coloneqq\\;\n\\{(A,B)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*):A\\leq_m^pB\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-karp-reduction|Karp Reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["69f4f24da36d1d66"]}